:18}}","team_breakdown":"{\"technical_founder\":{\"points\":22,\"max\":25,\"known\":true,\"why\":\"The founding story ties the core machine to Benedikt's mechanical-engineering master thesis in computer vision and ML, and the team includes a CTO.\",\"evidence\":[{\"trace_id\":\"site:karevo.de\",\"url\":\"https://karevo.de/de/impressum\",\"quote\":\"gegründet 2024 von Benedikt Keßler, Johannes von Wittke und Felix Beck\"},{\"trace_id\":\"tumvl:karevo\",\"url\":\"https://www.tum-venture-labs.de/teams/karevo/\",\"quote\":\"\"}],\"source\":\"strong\"},\"complementary_roles\":{\"points\":15,\"max\":15,\"known\":true,\"why\":\"Clear CEO, CTO and COO split gives business, technical and operational roles.\",\"evidence\":[{\"trace_id\":\"tumvl:karevo\",\"url\":\"https://www.tum-venture-labs.de/teams/karevo/\",\"quote\":\"\"}],\"source\":\"strong\"},\"worked_together\":{\"points\":0,\"max\":15,\"known\":false,\"why\":\"unknown; the traces do not state a prior shared lab, employer, project or collaboration before founding.\",\"evidence\":[],\"source\":\"strong\"},\"deep_research\":{\"points\":4,\"max\":10,\"known\":true,\"why\":\"There is a technical TUM master thesis basis, but no PhD or deeper research record is evidenced.\",\"evidence\":[{\"trace_id\":\"site:karevo.de\",\"url\":\"https://karevo.de/de/impressum\",\"quote\":\"Das Gründungsvorhaben basiert auf Benedikts Masterarbeit im Bereich Maschinenbau an der TUM\"}],\"source\":\"strong\"},\"earlier_startup\":{\"points\":0,\"max\":10,\"known\":false,\"why\":\"unknown; no earlier startup experience is mentioned.\",\"evidence\":[],\"source\":\"strong\"},\"industry_scar\":{\"points\":9,\"max\":10,\"known\":true,\"why\":\"Benedikt has first-hand agricultural pain from growing up on a potato farm and wanting such a machine for his own operation.\",\"evidence\":[{\"trace_id\":\"site:karevo.de\",\"url\":\"https://karevo.de/de/impressum\",\"quote\":\"Benedikt ist auf einem Kartoffelhof aufgewachsen\"}],\"source\":\"strong\"},\"con