_similar\":\"Provides AI-powered platform and services for large-scale battery asset optimisation and energy storage controls (competes in real-time battery optimisation).\",\"funding\":\"Public / corporate-backed energy storage company (widely reported).\",\"url\":\"https://www.marketsandmarkets.com/Market-Reports/battery-energy-storage-system-as-a-service-market-164234412.html\"},{\"name\":\"GridBeyond\",\"why_similar\":\"Distributed flexibility and optimisation platform for batteries and DERs, focusing on market participation and congestion/dispatch optimisation.\",\"funding\":\"Private, institutional-backed company (market reports reference GridBeyond in this space).\",\"url\":\"https://www.knowledge-sourcing.com/report/renewable-energy-curtailment-solutions-market\"},{\"name\":\"envelio\",\"why_similar\":\"Grid digital-twin and flexibility-management software used for congestion management and integration of storage and DERs (overlap with grid-congestion forecasting and scheduling).\",\"funding\":\"Privately funded energy-software company referenced in market analyses.\",\"url\":\"https://www.knowledge-sourcing.com/report/renewable-energy-curtailment-solutions-market\"},{\"name\":\"Wärtsilä (Energy Storage / Grid Services)\",\"why_similar\":\"Provides energy storage control, optimisation and grid services that overlap with utility-scale congestion management and dispatch optimisation.\",\"funding\":\"Large industrial / corporate player (Wärtsilä group).\",\"url\":\"https://www.knowledge-sourcing.com/report/renewable-energy-curtailment-solutions-market\"}]","series_a_risk":"medium","series_a_notes":"Series A survivability is plausible but not de-risked. Positives: low capex path to first revenues, strong regulatory tailwinds around congestion management and storage multi-use. Risks: crowded market, no found IP found in the web checks, likely long utility/storage-operator sales cycles, and need for trusted operational references before a credible Series A. Model 