ated sugars and custom glycoscience manufacturing; included in industry/NIH resource lists of suppliers.\",\"funding\":\"commercial supplier\",\"url\":\"https://commonfund.nih.gov/Glycoscience/otherresources\"}],\"github\":{\"commitment\":null,\"bus_factor\":null,\"note\":\"no GitHub org in the evidence\"},\"domain\":{\"domain\":\"eversyn.de\",\"registered\":null,\"first_certificate\":\"2022-04-05T00:00:00\",\"sources\":[\"https://rdap.org/domain/eversyn.de\",\"https://crt.sh/?q=eversyn.de\"]},\"press\":{\"first_public_at\":null,\"first_public_url\":null,\"days_ahead\":1054,\"still_invisible\":true,\"news_status\":\"checked: 1 result(s), still invisible\"},\"registry\":{\"note\":\"skipped: handelsregister.ai credential missing (flow 12)\"},\"series_a\":{\"capital_before_revenue\":\"Model judgement: low-to-moderate before first revenue. This is not a medtech-certification or heavy-hardware path; first sales can come from catalogue nucleotide sugars, custom synthesis and GMP-ready reagent batches. Main cash need is enzymatic/chemistry scale-up, QC/QA, inventory and proof that margins/reproducibility hold beyond small batches.\",\"sector_series_a_activity\":\"Model judgement: European Series A appetite is selective but real for life-science tools, biomanufacturing enablers and synthetic-biology infrastructure. Investors will likely require recurring reagent revenue, paid biopharma/nutrition collaborations, defensible IP/know-how and evidence that eversyn is more than a niche reagent supplier.\",\"tag\":\"model judgement unless a source is given\"},\"intro_links\":[{\"c\":\"cutanos\",\"o\":\"Max Planck Institute of Colloids\",\"city\":null,\"url\":\"https://www.htgf.de/en/portfolio/htgffamily/cutanos/\"}],\"web_error\":null,\"usage\":{\"web\":{\"input\":22932,\"output\":1789,\"searches\":7},\"strong\":{\"input\":503,\"output\":1722}},\"cost_usd\":0.1335}","deep_cost_usd":0.1335,"next_step":"Check before calling: investor money found (Seed round of €1.6 million led by bm