 reported in press coverage and institutional support.\",\"url\":\"https://www.lifesciencemarketresearch.com/insights/the-memo-vascudyne-engineering-regenerative-tissue-for-cardiovascular-repair\"},{\"name\":\"Xeltis\",\"why_similar\":\"Develops bioabsorbable polymeric vascular grafts that regenerate into living tissue — clinical-stage grafts for vascular applications.\",\"funding\":\"Reported significant financing for trials (multiple funding rounds referenced in industry coverage).\",\"url\":\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1742706125002703\"},{\"name\":\"Dialybrid\",\"why_similar\":\"Developing silk-based vascular grafts for dialysis access and other vascular applications — entered first-in-human trials.\",\"funding\":\"Raised €15M in a recent round reported in press.\",\"url\":\"https://techfundingnews.com/italian-medtech-dialybrid-raises-e15m-as-silk-based-vascular-graft-enters-first-in-human-trial/\"},{\"name\":\"VERIGRAFT\",\"why_similar\":\"Develops personalized tissue-engineered veins and vascular graft manufacturing methods — preclinical/scale-up work in vascular graft quality and production.\",\"funding\":\"Received national innovation (Vinnova) grant and collaborative funding (reported in press releases).\",\"url\":\"https://news.cision.com/se/59-north-communications/r/verigraft-to-use-ai-to-increase-quality-of-vascular-grafts%2Cc3893332\"}],\"github\":{\"commitment\":null,\"bus_factor\":null,\"note\":\"no GitHub org in the evidence\"},\"domain\":{\"domain\":\"vasc-on-demand.eu\",\"registered\":null,\"first_certificate\":\"2024-06-15T13:41:17\",\"sources\":[\"https://rdap.org/domain/vasc-on-demand.eu\",\"https://crt.sh/?q=vasc-on-demand.eu\"]},\"press\":{\"first_public_at\":\"2024-05-21T00:00:00.000Z\",\"first_public_url\":\"https://med.uni-wuerzburg.de/aktuelles/meldungen/single/news/blutgefaesse-auf-abruf\",\"days_ahead\":-225,\"still_invisible\":false,\"news_status\":\"checked: 13 result(s), first public mention found\"},\"registry\":{\"note\":\"skipped: handelsregister.ai credential missing (flow 12)\"},\"series_a\":{\"capital_before_revenue\":\"Model judgement: likely needs a meaningful seed-extension/bridge before first material revenue. If positioned as a preclinical research-tool / in-vitro vessel model, it can avoid implantable-device certification at first but still needs robust biological validation, reproducible manufacturing, QA, customer pilots with pharma/CROs and freedom-to-operate/IP licensing from the university. If it pivots toward implantable vascular grafts, capital need and time-to-revenue become much higher due to medtech/biomaterial regulatory and clinical requirements.\",\"sector_series_a_activity\":\"Model judgement: European Series A appetite is selective. Alternatives to animal testing, organ-on-chip and translational research tools are investable, but tissue-engineered vascular products are viewed as capital-intensive, validation-heavy and crowded. Series A investors will likely require paid pilots, strong pharma/CRO pull, clear university IP licence terms and evidence that the product is a research tool rather than a long clinical medtech path.\",\"tag\":\"model judgement unless a source is given\"},\"intro_links\":[],\"web_error\":null,\"usage\":{\"web\":{\"input\":13414,\"output\":1557,\"searches\":2},\"strong\":{\"input\":424,\"output\":1209}},\"cost_usd\":0.0649}","deep_cost_usd":0.0649,"next_step":"Check IP: Patent application listed for the project: 'DEVICE FOR FABRICATING A PERFUSABLE THREE-DIMENSIONAL TISSUE CONSTRUCT' — applicant: UNIVERSITAETSKLINIKUM WUERZBURG - KLINIKUM DER BAYERISCHEN JULIUS-MAXIMILIANS-UNIVERSITAT. (slow deal: IP with the university)","funding_status":"grants","funding_evidence":"Sieger des Businessplan Wettbewerbs Nordbayern 2025 (cohort:gruenderland.bayern:vasc-on-demand)","co_investors":"","age_warning":"","capital_need":"{\"points\":14,\"max\":15,\"known\":true,\"why\":\"Developing artificial human blood vessels (biofabrication/tissue-engineering) that must be brought to market — requires lab, materials/fabrication capacity and regulatory work.\",\"evidence\":[{\"trace_id\":\"cohort:gruenderland.bayern:vasc-on-demand\",\"url\":\"https://www.gruenderland.bayern/neuigkeiten/artikel/zukunftsweisende-innovationen-aus-franken-die-sieger-des-businessplan-wettbewerbs-nordbayern-2025/\",\"quote\":\"Setzt auf innovative künstliche Blutgefäße, um präklinische Studien zu verbessern und Tierversuche zu reduzieren.\"},{\"trace_id\":\"site:vasc-on-demand.eu\",\"url\":\"https://www.vasc-on-demand.eu/team/\",\"quote\":\"Our ultimate goal is to bring the first artificial human blood vessels to the market.\"}],\"hash\":\"1umlq6n\",\"model\":\"gpt-5-mini\",\"checked_at\":\"2026-11-20T23:43:21.250Z\"}","fit_score_v2":65,"fit_version":3,"site_checked_at":"2026-11-20T22:51:07.856Z","age_check":"{\"founded_year\":null,\"founded_url\":\"\",\"founded_quote\":\"\",\"rounds\":[{\"type\":\"grant\",\"lead_investor\":\"European Innovation Council / EIC Transition\",\"amount_eur_m\":2.5,\"date\":\"2024-05-16\",\"url\":\"https://www.ukw.de/aktuelle-meldungen/detail/news/blutgefaesse-auf-abruf/\",\"quote\":\"2,5 Millionen Euro für EIC Transition-Projekt Vasc-on-Demand.\"}],\"institutional\":null,\"register\":null,\"hq_country\":\"DE\",\"model\":\"gpt-5-mini\",\"checked_at\":\"2026-11-20T23:10:03.126Z\"}","updatedAt":"2026-11-20T23:43:31.368Z"},{"lead_key":"become-1","name":"Become.1","what":"Flexible employee benefits and HR tech automation offering a modular cafeteria system, integrations with HR and payroll, and automation to consolidate benefits in one place.","sector":"digital tech","city":"Heidelberg","stage":"pilot customers","people":"David Wambsganss (founder); Friedrich Villhauer (founder)","quotes":"[other] Founders: David Wambsganss, Friedrich Villhauer\n[other] Flexible employee benefits and HR tech automation offering a modular cafeteria system, integrations with HR and payroll, and automation to consolidate